.nh
.\" disable justification (adjust text to left margin only)
.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
checkXML6 \- An XML lint tool for KDE DocBook XML documents
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBcheckXML6\fR\ 'u
\fBcheckXML6\fR [\fIfilename\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBcheckXML6\fR
is a tool to check for syntax errors in
KDE
DocBook
XML
files\&. It can also be used for other DocBook based
XML
files, but you should use the less specific xmllint(1) tool if you are not writing or otherwise working on
KDE
documentation\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
meinproc6(1) xmllint(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
\fBLauri Watts\fR <\&lauri@kde\&.org\&>
.RS 4
Author.
.RE
